    "created_at": "2025-04-15T16:01:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-15T16:01:37Z",
    "body": "Where would you like to see the clarification? A Window's associated Document is only allocated in those two places. If you allocate a Document in other ways it can indeed have a null registry, but then it won't be a Window's associated Document (nor can it become that).",
