    "updated_at": "2025-04-15T20:58:14Z",
    "body": "Ah, I'm glad to know it's safe then!\n\nMight be overkill, but maybe the steps for getting window.customElements could be along the lines of:\n\n---\n\nThe Window customElements getter steps are:\n1. Assert that this's associated Document's custom element registry is not null.\n2. Return this's associated Document's custom element registry.\nNOTE: Documents associated with a Window are always constructed with a custom element registry.",
